1
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:06,511
Beloved land, 
Pearl of the Orient,

2
00:00:06,554 --> 00:00:10,302
The heart's fervor
In thy bosom is ever alive.

3
00:00:10,779 --> 00:00:14,573
Chosen land,
Thou art the cradle of the valiant,

4
00:00:14,724 --> 00:00:18,162
To the invaders
Thou shalt never be oppressed.

5
00:00:18,210 --> 00:00:22,378
Through the seas and mountains,
Through the air and thy blue sky,

6
00:00:22,412 --> 00:00:26,517
There is splendor in the poem
And song of liberation beloved.

7
00:00:26,527 --> 00:00:30,662
The sparkle of thy banner
Victoriously shines,

8
00:00:30,696 --> 00:00:34,990
Its stars and sun
Will never get dim.

9
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:43,179
Glorious land of the sun of glorious passion,
Life is heaven in thy arms;

10
00:00:43,260 --> 00:00:51,303
Our pleasure when there is an oppressor,
Is to suffer death for thee.